# F13-id: e1m1's start, the player's own eye, god mode, slop with the crosshair and the
# status bar; `impulse 9`, `impulse 4`, the trigger held from film second 0.5 ("So now
# they leave the barrels"). id's nails.
#
# Assembly (F13): the 470x520 crops at (725,450), from the cross down to the gun, of
# F13-id and F13-barrels, enlarged 2x (nearest), side by side at (13,20) and (967,20) of a
# black 1920x1080 frame, labelled "nails: id's" and "nails: from the barrels". The sound
# is F13-barrels'.

map e1m1

duration 4
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset slop
hud on
gun on
crosshair 1
player 480,-352,88,90
cvar gamma 0.8
cvar r_nailbarrels 0

impulse 9 at 0
impulse 4 at 0.1
attack on at 0.5

camera player

sound off
events on
